-- Smash history: top 8s for the biggest majors before start.gg (Matthew, 2026-11-18: "Continue with top 8s
-- and entrant counts"). Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome from each tournament's own Liquipedia page (its
-- placement table), one page at a time, several seconds apart: 33 games across 29 majors, the
-- biggest Melee majors from 2003 to 2016 and the biggest Smash 4 ones. Early MLG and Tournament Go pages
-- list only their top 3 to 6. No new entrant counts: those pages don't have them. Facts only; credited to
-- Liquipedia (CC-BY-SA) like the rest of these majors. Only replaces the winner/runner-up saved by
-- 20270111100000 for these hand-added majors; safe to run twice.

update public.major_events e
